# Coach speech (Romanian): the appraisal after the game (src/coach/appraisal.cpp).
# Same keys and variants as assets/coach/speech/en/appraisal.lang (its header documents every placeholder).
# The appraisal is always positive and never blames. The coach says "tu"; the player's gender is
# unknown: no adjective or participle agrees with the player. Use the active past ("ai câștigat",
# "ai găsit"), the invariable "gata" ("Ești gata pentru…"), nouns and impersonal phrasing ("aveai o
# poziție câștigată", "Bine jucat.", "Bine găsit.").
#
# Names inserted by {text}, {theme}, {level}, {opening} (written to fit every line that inserts them):
#   appraisal.phase.*   with their article ("deschiderea", "jocul de mijloc", "finalul"): only as a
#                       subject, a direct object or after a colon, never after a preposition
#                       ("în deschidere" would need the bare noun).
#   appraisal.reason.*  a complement after "Remiză, {text}." ("prin pat", "de comun acord").
#   theme.*             a noun phrase in lower case, no full stop ("căutarea matului, începând cu
#                       șahurile"), always said after a colon.
#   appraisal.level.*   the coach page's level name in „ ”, always after "nivelul":
#                       "la nivelul „Începător”".
#   {opening:def}       the opening's name with its article after a verb ("Am jucat {opening:def}.");
#                       {opening} alone (the citation name) after a colon or on its own.
# Accuracy: "{acc:percent}" = "85 %" (spoken "optzeci și cinci la sută"), "o precizie de {acc:percent}".
# Move numbers stay cardinal: "la mutarea {n}", "Mutarea {n}:". The game's length: "{moves:in_move}" =
# "în 25 de mutări" (it carries its "în"). A count never starts a sentence (it renders in lower case):
# the short levels give a bare number after a label ("Piese capturate: {n:f}", "șahuri: {m:neut}").
# Hanging: "în priză" or "fără apărare" (no agreement). Never a predicative "neapărat" ("era neapărat"),
# which is heard as the adverb "necessarily": "nu era apăra{my:agr_t}" for a loose piece.

